# Releases and the supply chain (docs/guide/how-releases.md).
title: Every rung of the ladder is gated, and only a signed v* release reaches a user's machine
direction: down
dev: dev: reviewed pull requests merge here
cand: promote/… branch holds the exact merge commit
gate: ci.yml gate on the candidate
rolling: rolling, tagged rolling-<date>
main: main, annotated vX.Y.Z tag
rel: release.yml builds, signs, attests
user: install.sh checks signature, then SHA-256
dev -> cand: aayu release
cand -> gate: gate=rolling|stable
gate -> rolling: green: fast-forward
rolling -> main: stable gate green
main -> rel: v* tag push
rel -> user: signed assets
